You can only create OTP for SMS channel.

The Verify API enables you to generate, send, and verify OTP codes for the WhatsApp channel. Ensure that the provided template name exists and corresponds to the authentication template name you created through your WhatsApp Business Account.

After you create a channel for your brand, you can create OTP templates.

This API key is sensitive and should never be used on the frontend or mobile SDK; it should only be implemented on the backend.

Body Parameters

Parameter
Description
Data Type
Required
Rules

channel
Channel that you will send the OTP code. It will be WhatsApp.
String
Yes
oneof:whatsapp

locale
Determines the language/locale in which the OTP code message will be sent.
String
Yes
oneof:pt af sq ar az bn bg ca zh_CN zh_HK zh_TW hr cs da nl en en_GB en_US et fil fi fr ka de el gu ha he hi hu id ga it ja kn kk rw_RW ko ky_KG lo lv lt mk ms ml mr nb fa pl pt_BR pt_PT pa ro ru sr sk sl es es_AR es_ES es_MX sw sv ta te th tr uk ur uz vi zu

templateName
The template name that will be inserted
String
Yes
The template has to exist already.

